/.lake

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LaTeX build artifacts
#
# The books in this repo are built to PDF in CI (see
# .github/workflows/build-books.yml) and published to GitHub Releases, so the
# generated output is no longer committed. Only the .tex sources are tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.nav
*.out
*.snm
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.vrb
*.xdv

# minted / pygments cache (regenerated on every build)
_minted/
_minted-*/
.minted-cache/

# Built PDFs (produced in CI, published to Releases)
*.pdf

# ...except the hand-authored guide, which has no .tex source and cannot be
# regenerated, so it stays under version control.
!lambda-calc/lambda_calculus_guide.pdf
